== Usage ==

This template displays one crafting recipe.

<pre>
{{Recipe
| Name = Aeolian Scimitar
| Primary Skill = Blacksmithing
| Primary Skill Level = 50
| Crystal 1 = Earth Shard
| Crystal 1 Amount = 12
| Crystal 2 = Fire Shard
| Crystal 2 Amount = 13
| Ingredients = Blunt Aeolian Scimitar, Aldgoat Leather, Brass Ingot, Brimstone
| Main Hand NQ = Aeolian Scimitar
| Off Hand NQ = Aeolian Scimitar
}}
</pre>

The Craft row always appears. It shows <code>Unknown</code> when
<code>Primary Skill</code> is omitted. Other rows appear only when filled in.

Optional fields include:

* <code>Secondary Skill</code> and <code>Secondary Skill 2</code>, with their corresponding <code>Level</code> fields.
* <code>Main Hand HQ+1</code> through <code>HQ+3</code>, and the <code>Off Hand</code> equivalents.
* <code>Training 1</code> and <code>Training 2</code>.
* <code>Guild Facilities</code> and <code>Simple Facilities</code> flags.

[[Module:Recipe]] splits ingredients at commas and preserves their order and
repeats. List an ingredient twice when the recipe needs two of it.
</noinclude>
